# All text files in this repository are LF-only.
#
# The rule is stated in CONTRIBUTING.md and AGENTS.md, and it used to be
# enforced here until .gitattributes was deleted in the 2026-08 cleanup that
# emptied main. A stated convention nothing enforces is a convention that
# survives exactly until the first contributor on Windows opens a pull request
# against the docs, which is the only kind of pull request this repository
# accepts.
*  text=auto eol=lf
